Z||000011||JSocha||08-31-2001||01:38 PM||||Good points about accepting the chips.  However, the G has suggested that when the technology is available, it will be mandatory to be implanted and registered at birth.<P>I'm trying to find the website now.  I thought it was (maybe is) on American Expose (http://www.amerikanexpose.com).<P>Our legislation (along with other countries) is attempting to pass it here in our country without the general poplulations knowledge and/or input on the subject.  Just one day...BAM!...new law.  Newborns-implanted after birth.  Current live population over a short period of time is to have secondary chips implanted and tagged, yes tagged! to a bone or between a joint, to which you will have to pay for and submit confirmation that the operation had been performed.<P>Its organizations like Amerikan Expose watching out for our general interest by uncovering hidden agendas of our legislative boards and governments that the media will not talk about.  Just like NAM (National Association of Manufacturers) who keep the manufacturing industry alerted to possible laws that can be detrimental to the Mfg. industry.<P>The hush, hush under the table routine.<P>But really, it all boils down to really there is no conspiracy going on or being perpetuated by our G.<P>Now the UFO, possibility of aliens visiting our planet or if they have, how do we know our G is not working on a plan to make us all future "drones" if a technology, not of our world, is introduced?<P>I'm starting to really get out there in left field...so I'll come back to the world of the living and current reality.<P>But before I go, it is all about possibilities.  And the AZ DD would raise more questions then it would answer, especially when it is a dam, located in a dry area, where the ground itself is sandy and would absorb large amounts of moisture, unless it is located in a low area of Phx where a flash flood could occur.  But the question is, where is it being diverted to and how?<P>